  "zipball_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/ctxrs/ctx/zipball/v2.2.8",
  "body": "Released: 2026-10-05\n\n### Fixed\n\n- Incremental imports reuse validated ownership for accepted Codex appends, avoiding repeated reads of large, unchanged prefixes.\n- Unfinished trailing records resume from the last complete record instead of replaying completed history. Replacement, truncation, and appended ownership conflicts still trigger validation; exhaustive imports still check historical bytes.\n- Worker compatibility checks use executable file metadata instead of reading the entire binary on each import. Strict executable verification remains in place when signalling another process.\n- Background blame maintenance selects the current history after acquiring the writer lock, so a queued worker cannot publish stale attribution. Logical writer leases release their native lock even when a duplicated file descriptor remains open.\n\nTantivy index merging is unchanged.\n\n- Source commit: [56aaf35233ce7f8aa739c207525a3d67e6ddddbd](https://github.com/ctxrs/ctx/commit/56aaf35233ce7f8aa739c207525a3d67e6ddddbd)\n\n[Full changes](https://github.com/ctxrs/ctx/compare/v2.2.7...v2.2.8).\n"
}
